## Interface: 120100
## Title: GearSweep
## Notes: Sweeps your bank and Warband Bank for disenchant fodder and class/spec upgrades.
## Author: Tharavol, Claude
## Version: @project-version@
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\ability_racial_skeletonpinkie
